Added the private `artifactory-pypi` Poetry package source to the `nautobot-app-commercial` cookie, so baked commercial apps can resolve dependencies published only to Network to Code's Artifactory.
Added Artifactory credential plumbing to the `nautobot-app-commercial` cookie, passing `ARTIFACTORY_USERNAME` and `ARTIFACTORY_PASSWORD` to the development image build as Docker BuildKit secrets and exposing them to Poetry in CI.
